<p>Target a nearby shadow, and command it to merge into a nearby enemy, reducing their damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 20%, 27%, 34%, 40%</acronym> for 5 turns.</p><p>Killing your shadow releases some of your inner hatred, restoring 8 Hate to yourself.</p>